WEBVTT

00:06:29.279 --> 00:06:34.306
Hvala vam, mir i blagoslov.

00:06:34.312 --> 00:06:39.944
(Aplauz)

00:06:39.944 --> 00:06:42.715
Hvala vam.
(Aplauz)

00:06:42.715 --> 00:06:46.015
Pet Mičel: Čuli ste Maju kako priča

00:06:46.015 --> 00:06:48.838
o svojim divnim roditeljima koji stoje iza

00:06:48.838 --> 00:06:51.055
ove neverovatne devojke.
Gde su oni?

00:06:51.055 --> 00:06:54.053
Molim vas, Gospodine i Gospođo Pen.
Da li biste samo... Ah!

00:06:54.053 --> 00:06:57.807
(Aplauz)